<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-2</name><desc>G-2 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It runs 3.9 km from the T-3 junction to the Chereshnana junction, climbing about 135 m and descending 226 m in the direction drawn, between 1,395 m and 1,617 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-2/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
<wpt lat="41.076230" lon="20.846640"><name>G-2 start</name><desc>the T-3 junction</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.045981" lon="20.840896"><name>G-2 end</name><desc>the Chereshnana junction</desc><sym>Trail Head</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.076342" lon="20.846472"><name>P-19</name><desc>Park guidepost. </desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.045978" lon="20.840728"><name>(no number)</name><desc>Park guidepost. Trails here: H-6, H-4, G-2; guidepost destroyed - signs on the ground with proper directions..</desc><sym>Flag</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.046196" lon="20.839219"><name>Trail map board</name><desc>Park board with the map and table of trails.</desc><sym>Information</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="41.066144" lon="20.845669"><name>Tri Mazhi peak</name><desc>Три Мажи. 1625 m</desc><sym>Summit</sym></wpt>
<trk><name>G-2: the T-3 junction to the Chereshnana junction</name><desc>G-2 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It runs 3.9 km from the T-3 junction to the Chereshnana junction, climbing about 135 m and descending 226 m in the direction drawn, between 1,395 m and 1,617 m.</desc><type>G</type><extensions><gpxx:TrackExtension><gpxx:DisplayColor>Yellow</gpxx:DisplayColor></gpxx:TrackExtension><gpx_style:line><gpx_style:color>D4A20B</gpx_style:color><gpx_style:width>4</gpx_style:width></gpx_style:line></extensions><trkseg><trkpt lat="41.076230" lon="20.846640"><ele>1488</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.076157" lon="20.846653"><ele>1488</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.076081" lon="20.846706"><ele>1491</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.076010" lon="20.846689"><ele>1494</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.076020" lon="20.846619"><ele>1493</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.076003" lon="20.846608"><ele>1493</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075918" lon="20.846661"><ele>1498</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075798" lon="20.846642"><ele>1502</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075753" lon="20.846626"><ele>1503</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075727" lon="20.846575"><ele>1503</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075635" lon="20.846581"><ele>1506</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075550" lon="20.846593"><ele>1509</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075498" lon="20.846567"><ele>1510</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075434" lon="20.846622"><ele>1512</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075433" lon="20.846624"><ele>1512</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075416" lon="20.846658"><ele>1512</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075295" lon="20.846556"><ele>1515</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075262" lon="20.846556"><ele>1516</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075234" lon="20.846448"><ele>1517</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075198" lon="20.846414"><ele>1518</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075190" lon="20.846401"><ele>1519</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075183" lon="20.846388"><ele>1519</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.075178" lon="20.846379"><ele>1519</ele></trkpt><trkpt lat="41.07